    "Allow for this chat: %@ runs without asking in this chat, with any arguments, until the time limit set on the Mac ends (1 hour by default). If the tool can write, that includes any write.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow for this chat: %@ runs without asking in this chat, with any arguments, until the time limit set on the Mac ends (1 hour by default). If the tool can write, that includes any write."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu sohbet boyunca izin ver: %@ aracı, Mac’te ayarlanan süre sınırı dolana kadar (varsayılan 1 saat) bu sohbette tüm parametrelerle sormadan çalışır. Araç yazma yetkisine sahipse bu izin tüm yazma işlemlerini de kapsar."
